WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.597
We've got an incredible woman to tell you about.

2
00:00:02.597 --> 00:00:05.760
"The Washington Post" reports that a teacher in Virginia

3
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.580
named Jennifer Williams has made it her personal mission

4
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.612
to give away one million books to kids for free.

5
00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:12.838
(audience cheers)
(audience applauds)

6
00:00:12.838 --> 00:00:15.340
A million books?
The book lady

7
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:20.160
has already given away 90,500 books,

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.590 line:15%
spending tens of thousands of dollars of her own money.

9
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.360 line:15%
And she teaches fifth grade

10
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.890 line:15%
and tutors on the side to make it all happen.

11
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.040 line:15%
She brings books to students at schools,

12
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.730 line:15%
and stocks local libraries,

13
00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:36.860 line:15%
and builds boxes and those little like house things.

14
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:37.693 line:15%
I love those.

15
00:00:37.693 --> 00:00:38.526 line:15%
I have one of those in my neighborhood.

16
00:00:38.526 --> 00:00:39.382 line:15%
Take a book, leave a book?

17
00:00:39.382 --> 00:00:40.215 line:15%
Yeah, yeah.
Yeah.

18
00:00:40.215 --> 00:00:41.390 line:15%
There's one right there.
Uh-huh, mm-hmm.

19
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:44.120 line:15%
And Jennifer says, "Having books at home

20
00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.930 line:15%
can make all the difference in developing vocabulary

21
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.270 line:15%
and communication skills."

22
00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:51.530
And I will say, Jennifer, that I am completely self-taught

23
00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.410
and it is totally from books.

24
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.110
So I commend you. I thank you.

25
00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.350
And keep up the good work!
(audience applauds)

26
00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.271
Thank you,

27
00:00:59.271 --> 00:01:00.298
thank you, thank you.
Yes, yes.

28
00:01:00.298 --> 00:01:01.131
Amazing.

29
